nsive and if you live in a food  desert or you don't have a ton of extra  income it's harder to make that decision  be thoughtful all around for people it's  not hurting you people like to poke fun  at us but we're all about like not  hurting you not hurting me everyone can  do their own thing even though I think  everyone should be a vegetarian  eventually we'd have to phase out  [Music]
 

